            Some approved repairs may be paid through closing.
          </h2>
          <p
            data-en="For qualifying transactions, SAFE may approve a written payment-at-closing arrangement so authorized work can be completed before funds are disbursed. This is never automatic: the scope, price, responsible party, closing date and payment instructions must be accepted in writing by SAFE and allowed by the lender and settlement/closing professionals before work begins."
            data-es="En transacciones que califican, SAFE puede aprobar por escrito un acuerdo de pago al cierre para que el trabajo autorizado se complete antes del desembolso. No es automático: alcance, precio, responsable, fecha de cierre e instrucciones de pago deben ser aceptados por SAFE y permitidos por el lender y los profesionales de settlement/cierre antes de comenzar."
          >
            For qualifying transactions, SAFE may approve a written
            payment-at-closing arrangement so authorized work can be completed
            before funds are disbursed. This is never automatic: the scope,
            price, responsible party, closing date and payment instructions must
            be accepted in writing by SAFE and allowed by the lender and
            settlement/closing professionals before work begins.
          </p>
        </div>
