              Lender and closing-office permission
            </li>
            <li
              data-en="Signed payment and change-order terms"
              data-es="Términos firmados de pago y change orders"
            >
              Signed payment and change-order terms
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p
            data-en="If the closing is delayed or cancelled, the signed agreement controls when and by whom payment is due."
            data-es="Si el cierre se atrasa o cancela, el acuerdo firmado controla cuándo y por quién se debe pagar."
          >
            If the closing is delayed or cancelled, the signed agreement
            controls when and by whom payment is due.
          </p>
        </aside>
